<title>CANADA: Tembec Q4 Sept 30 profit turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Tembec Q4 Sept 30 profit turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			   1995</p>
<p> Shr   Loss		  C$0.21   Profit	C$0.91</p>
<p> Net   Loss		   9,567   Profit	40,022</p>
<p> Revs			 268,096		  329,397</p>
<p>	    12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr    Loss		 C$0.05   Profit	C$2.96</p>
<p> Net    Loss		    281   Profit     120,016</p>
<p> Revs			 990,939		  993,277</p>
<p> Avg shrs		    46,816		   40,198</p>
<p>		(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Tembec Inc. Fully diluted earnings per share have not been reported for 1996 as they result in a decrease in loss per share. In 1995, fully diluted profit per share was C$0.81 in the fourth quarter and C$2.55 for the full year.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Montreal bureau (514) 985-2434</p>
